{"nodes": [{"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design", "label": "Design - Endurecer la especificacion OpenAPI segun el Security Audit de 42Crunch", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_openapi_generation_pipeline", "label": "openapi.yaml generated from src/openapi/*.ts via z.registry() + z.toJSONSchema (openapi-3.0, io input)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_42crunch_security_audit", "label": "42Crunch Security Audit (VSCode extension)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Applies far stricter API security rules than redocly lint --extends=minimal, which already passed with 0 errors."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_blocking_banner_structural_semantic_issues", "label": "Blocking banner: Your API has structural or semantic issues", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d1_strict_object_only_owned_response_contracts", "label": "D1: z.strictObject() only in fully owned response contracts (13 schemas)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only objects whose contract the code fully controls are closed; IssueContent, technicianInfo and everything reusing IssuePayload/IssueBatchRequest stay open because mappings drive the content and payloads echo real Jira data."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d2_freetext_token_helpers", "label": "D2: two string helpers freeText(max) and token(max)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blocking only control characters closes log-injection style vectors without false rejections; per-field strict patterns would be fragile against real Jira/TC data."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d3_validator_maxlength_only", "label": "D3: real validator gets only maxLength, no pattern (explicit user decision)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It is the only runtime-sensitive file touched; a generous max cannot reject real traffic whereas a regex could reject free text from Jira. Because IssuePayload is reused by $ref, the no-pattern finding also persists in the response bucket."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d4_status_code_bounds_100_599", "label": "D4: error statusCode bounded to 100-599", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zod 4 translated the unbounded integer to +-9007199254740991, a semantically absurd HTTP status range."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d5_servers_absolute_parametrized_url", "label": "D5: servers uses an absolute parametrized URL instead of relative '/'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Direct evidence from the audit banner link isolated this Critical finding as the blocker; server variables keep multi-environment portability without a fixed URL."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d6_document_only_verified_real_responses", "label": "D6: document only HTTP responses verified as real behavior (404, 429, default; not 406/415)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documenting a response the API cannot give is a false contract, worse than leaving the finding open."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_d7_verify_banner_hypothesis_before_discarding", "label": "D7: verify banner hypothesis before discarding low-impact findings", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A finding with zero score impact may still block analysis; each round was designed only around a verifiable hypothesis."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_lesson_zero_impact_finding_may_block", "label": "Lesson: a zero-score-impact finding can still be structural", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_free_text_helper", "label": "freeText(max) helper (src/openapi/schemas.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-especificacion-openapi-42crunch/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_07_endurecer_especificacion_openapi_42crunch_design_token_helper", "label": "token(max) helper (src/openapi/schemas.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-07-endurecer-e